        "TileImage": "$($repository b00aa9b3-5ca2-4e97-b8e8-30cae5dcee99).Image",
        "Description": "Good day agent,\r\rThe famous annual event in Mendoza attracts a lot of influencial people and there are some that wish to take advantage of this. A group of anarchists have infiltrated the party disguised as waiters and plan to take out key people in their line of business by poisoning them so they can become the monopoly and rule the sector.  Kill these waiters before they kill them.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare...\r\rOriginal by : Baluelchefe (PlayStation)",
